      look: 'One step in the chamber where you wrote "look at making the chambers on the second level larger (for when encounters happen in them)" and a fight comes (the door sets the count to one). On the simple screen the field is the chamber cut open between the two lines -- in your play record two of three giant bats "paced: it cannot get at anyone" all fight, walled off in pockets; now they come at you. On Lymen\'s turn SKILL: SACRED WEAPON has ROOST on its right in red (it ended your 18:45 fight at one click), as Aurdin\'s LIGHT has under MAGIC. After the fight, walk down out of the chamber to the way, east to 19,10, then south onto the pit (19,11): the floor goes, and in the deep gallery a pop-up with each one\'s fall, OK to finish. And since your "Leans stand" on "can we do victory (xp rewards, etc) on the fight screen instead of the roam screen after return from the fight?": win the chamber\'s fight and its last card says Victory!, each one\'s XP and the spoils above E back to the dens; the floor after says only that the way is clear.',
